```json
{"translation": "Yet for inflammation and scirrhus and oedema, for erysipelas and putrefaction, for herpes and gangrene, none [708] of them any longer attempts to seek the cure for himself, since each such condition is by now too great a matter for a layman's judgement and requires some more august knowledge; and they call such knowledge medicine, and the one who practises it a physician. They themselves advance only so far as to know that the hollow ulcer needs filling with flesh, the foul ulcer cleansing, and the level ulcer cicatrization; but they do not know the drug that fills with flesh, or cleanses, or cicatrizes. In the same way, if they have a muscle or a tendon that is hard or tense or slack, they know precisely that the hard one has need of softening drugs, the tense one of relaxing drugs, and the slack one of tightening drugs; but they do not know the drug that softens or relaxes or tightens. Finding such things is the work of the physician alone. For as far as heating and cooling, moistening and drying drugs go, one can find some of the laymen sharing with the physicians in the discovery of drugs; but in the matters just mentioned, all of them are entirely without experience.", "renderings": [{"target_no": 5, "surface": "οἰδήματος,", "english": "oedema", "uncertain": "n"}, {"target_no": 6, "surface": "ἐρυσιπέλατός", "english": "erysipelas", "uncertain": "n"}, {"target_no": 9, "surface": "σηπεδόνος,", "english": "putrefaction", "uncertain": "n"}, {"target_no": 43, "surface": "ἰατρικὴν", "english": "medicine", "uncertain": "n"}, {"target_no": 95, "surface": "χαλαρὸν", "english": "slack", "uncertain": "n"}, {"target_no": 109, "surface": "χαλώντων,", "english": "relaxing drugs", "uncertain": "n"}, {"target_no": 112, "surface": "χαλαρῷ", "english": "the slack one", "uncertain": "n"}, {"target_no": 148, "surface": "ἐνίους", "english": "some", "uncertain": "n"}], "uncertain_greek": ["ὡς μείζονος ἤδη τῶν τοιούτων ἑκάστου ὑπάρχοντος ἢ κατὰ γνώμην ἰδιώτου", "σεμνοτέρας", "ἐπουλώσεως"]}
```

