{"translation": "Entering, then, through each of the pores in rare bodies (such as are all ulcerated parts, and the eyes, the nostrils, the mouth and the parts about the stomach), the cold lays hold of all the parts of the bodies being cooled and, as it were with many [623] grips all round, gathering them together and compressing them, tears them away from the parts continuous with them. In this affection, then, not a few empty spaces must come to be, not only because the thin fluids are pressed and excreted, but also because the soft substance is drawn together into a smaller place. But an empty space cannot arise in continuous bodies while their continuity is preserved. If, then, one does arise, it is clear that this continuity is destroyed and the continuous body is torn apart; and in this the affection of sensation that is at once distressing and biting presents itself. Yet the quality of both is not the same, of the things that bite by cooling and of those that bite by heating. In the former we at once also have a perception of the substance being drawn together and constricted; in the latter, a perception of its being dissolved and diffused. Moreover, the speed is not alike in the two affections: with cooling things the biting is somehow slower, whereas with heating things it passes through most swiftly.", "renderings": [{"target_no": 42, "surface": "λαβαῖς", "english": "grips", "uncertain": "n"}, {"target_no": 48, "surface": "συνεχῶν", "english": "the parts continuous with them", "uncertain": "n"}, {"target_no": 90, "surface": "συνεχείας.", "english": "continuity", "uncertain": "n"}, {"target_no": 113, "surface": "δακνῶδες", "english": "biting", "uncertain": "n"}, {"target_no": 120, "surface": "ποιότης", "english": "quality", "uncertain": "n"}, {"target_no": 121, "surface": "ἀμφοῖν", "english": "both", "uncertain": "n"}, {"target_no": 156, "surface": "δευτέρων", "english": "the latter", "uncertain": "n"}, {"target_no": 183, "surface": "δῆξις,", "english": "the biting", "uncertain": "n"}], "uncertain_greek": ["πιλοῦν", "ὑπαντᾷ", "χεῖσθαι"]}
```

